{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>23 歲瑜伽導師周慧賢於 2022 年 6 月失蹤，警方其後發現她伏屍尖沙咀麗思卡爾頓酒店（The Ritz-Carlton）房內的浴缸，身中逾 30 刀。死者前男友被控一項謀殺罪，據司法機構網頁顯示，案件將於下周一（11 月 2 日）開審，預料審期 15 日，但未列有主審法官。</p>\n\n<p>被告勞浚銘（被控時 28 歲）被控一項謀殺罪。控罪指，被告於 2022 年 6 月 29 日至 6 月 30 日期間，於香港尖沙咀麗思卡爾頓酒店一房間內謀殺女子周慧賢。</p>\n<p><em><a href=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/subscription/?utm_source=website&amp;utm_medium=article&amp;utm_campaign=subscription\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">訂閱／贊助／購物</a>，支持《法庭線》</em><em>報道香港，記錄香港。</em></p>\n<p></p>\nHCCC148/2024","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T03:01:18.778252+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":267,"images":0,"source":"The Witness","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T11:47:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T09:38:15.489747+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T02:58:11.340497+00:00","content_hash":"b0d43e220476d9723aed023746ae7a5af367e64d12439ac057fddef54b9772c6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}